<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>“Draw near to God and He’ll draw near to you,”</l><l>Come, breathe Him in, and be filled through and through;</l><l>He’s the Spirit—like the air,</l><l>We can breathe Him anywhere;</l><l>“Draw near to God and He’ll draw near to you!”</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>“Draw near to God and He’ll draw near to you.”</l><l>Behold His face, with glory be infused;</l><l>In His presence be renewed;</l><l>Be revived, enlivened too!</l><l>“Draw near to God and He’ll draw near to you!”</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>“Draw near to God and He’ll draw near to you;”</l><l>Come eat and drink the feast that’s spread for you;</l><l>Boldly eat the tree of life!</l><l>Freely drink the living tide!</l><l>“Draw near to God and He’ll draw near to you!”</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>“Draw near to God and He’ll draw near to you,”</l><l>And be unveiled and see a heav’nly view;</l><l>Eyes and hearts have never known</l><l>All the Spirit wants to show;</l><l>“Draw near to God and He’ll draw near to you!”</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
